+[03_audit_smoke.mpy](/audit-output/evidence/03_audit_smoke.mpy). The command
+
+```text
+krun audit-smoke.mpy --definition audit-runtime-kompiled
+```
+
+exited 0 with final `<k> .K </k>`, `<exc> NoExc </exc>`, and
+`<exit-code> 0 </exit-code>`; see
